[00:19.18]“The signs of the times” prove God’s rule has begun.
[00:26.04]In glory enthroned sits Jehovah’s Son.
[00:32.46]The heavens are cleansed, Satan’s now debased,
[00:39.00]And soon on the earth let God’s will take place.
[00:45.54](Chorus)
[00:45.69]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[00:53.14]And he himself resides with them.
[00:59.43]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[01:05.86]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[01:12.67]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[01:19.60]These words faithful are and true.
[01:24.64]Let all men the pure New Jerusalem see,
[01:51.60]The bride of the Lamb shining radiantly.
[01:58.13]Adorned for her husband in gems so bright,
[02:04.94]And only Jehovah will be her light.
[02:12.53](Chorus)
[02:12.68]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[02:19.06]And he himself resides with them.
[02:25.41]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[02:31.92]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[02:38.62]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[02:45.40]These words faithful are and true.
[02:50.88]This city so grand will become a delight.
[03:21.42]Its gates will be open both day and night.
[03:27.62]The nations will walk in her glory bright;
[03:34.08]The servants of God now reflect that light.
[03:41.43](Chorus)
[03:41.58]Rejoice! For God’s tent is with men,
[03:48.24]And he himself resides with them.
[03:54.60]No more will there be pain or worrying,
[04:01.22]No sting of death nor any sorrowing.
[04:07.80]For God has said: ‘I’m making all things new.’
[04:15.86]These words faithful are and true.
